            "avatar_1": "shopify://shop_images/1.jpg",
            "testimonial_2": "Focus on Stress & Productivity\n\nCalm, steady productivity\" \"What I love most about this supplement is that it doesn't just rev your brain up—it actually helps you stay calm under pressure. The GABA and L-Tyrosine seem to really help with my daily stress response. I feel more balanced, less overwhelmed by heavy workloads, and completely capable of knocking out my to-do list.",
