            "avatar_3": "shopify://shop_images/3.png",
            "testimonial_4": "Focus on Clean Energy (No Jitters)\n\nClean energy with zero crash\" \"I’ve tried plenty of focus supplements and energy drinks in the past, but most of them leave me shaking or crashing a few hours later. This formula is completely different. It delivers a very clean, sustained lift in alertness. One capsule in the morning keeps me productive all day long. Highly recommend for anyone needing a mental boost.",
